I found and fixed a critical bug in the arithmetic expression parser. The issue was in the `advance()` method of the `Parser` struct, which was not incrementing the position pointer (`p.pos`). This caused an infinite loop when the parser tried to consume tokens, leading to a stack overflow panic.

